{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52143","headline":"因致酒欢会述志爲诗 · 明解","name":"因致酒欢会述志爲诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一乘本非有，三空何所归？\n幸得金门诏，行背玉毫晖。\n未能齐物我，犹怀识是非。\n赖尔同心契，知余志不违。\n幕齐云叶卷，酒度榴花飞。\n寄语绳牀执，辞君匡坐威。\n（见《卍续藏经》本唐释怀信撰《释门自镜录》卷中。\n《续高僧传》卷三五录首二句）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"明解","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}